Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 02:13:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 19/32] [DevTools] Revert network overrides on redirects to
 restricted URLs

Network overrides applied at navigation start persisted across redirects
to URLs the session's client may not attach to. Before force-detaching
restricted sessions on redirect, revert the extra headers they set on
the in-flight navigation request to the value set by a session that may
still apply overrides, or else to the browser's original value, and
block the navigation if such a session overrode the Referer header.

Bug: 553259600
